{"id":"pesadelo","lemma":"pesadelo","pos":"noun","rank":1466,"glosses":["nightmare"],"ipa":"/pe.zaˈde.lu/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"pesadelos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Jessie_Edwin_Lawrence-pesadelo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eu ainda tenho pesadelos.","en":"I still have nightmares.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/536225","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"still"},{"g":"have","l":"ter"},null]},{"text":"Tive um pesadelo.","en":"I had a nightmare.","words":[{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Você tem pesadelos?","en":"Do you have nightmares?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},null]},{"text":"Tom teve um pesadelo.","en":"Tom had a bad dream.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/495480","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ele não tinha pesadelos.","en":"He didn't have nightmares.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},null]}]}